        }
      ],
      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   No 80 TL 0507 1/166             20.12.76. II*                       GV 2. Timber framework exposed internally of C15 or early C16 structure.  Refaced C18 and C19.  Colour washed brick, parapet screening roof.  3 storeys, 2 sash nearly flush windows to upper floors, 2nd floor window aprons.  C19 ground floor projecting shop front with wooden mullions to segmentally headed lights. Nos 48 to 88 (even); Nos 94 to 100 (even) and Barn in garden of Nos 62 and 64 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0548407954"
    }
